@startuml
title Redis Commander TUI - Cluster scan и консоль

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant "RedisCommanderUI" as UI
participant "Cluster Client" as Cluster
participant "Master Node A" as NodeA
participant "Master Node B" as NodeB
participant "Console" as Console

== Сканирование кластера ==
"Пользователь" -> UI: Подключиться к cluster profile
UI -> Cluster: connect_to_profile()
UI -> Cluster: refresh_keys()
Cluster -> NodeA: SCAN + TYPE
NodeA --> Cluster: keys and types
Cluster -> NodeB: SCAN + TYPE
NodeB --> Cluster: keys and types
Cluster --> UI: merged unique key list

== Команды консоли ==
"Пользователь" -> Console: Ввести команду
Console -> UI: execute_console_command()

alt KEYS / SCAN / INFO / DBSIZE / FLUSH*
  UI -> Cluster: специальная обработка cluster-команд
  Cluster -> NodeA: выполнить на master
  Cluster -> NodeB: выполнить на master
  Cluster --> UI: aggregated result
else Обычная команда
  UI -> Cluster: execute_command(cmd, args)
  Cluster --> UI: result
end

UI --> Console: formatted output

@enduml
